        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e495f1/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-23T19:59:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi Craig,</p>\n<p>Hey Craig,</p>\n<p>Many thanks for your swift response :)! I understand you can’t have the details on the KS pledge levels. I was hoping that by showing some proof of my pledge to you (the fulfiller), you would trust that I didn’t get what I pledged for. I can understand you’d rather follow the instructions given by Darrell.</p>\n<p>Unfortunately, I’ve been trying to get in touch with him, but I get the impression that my mails are ignored (I’m also commenting on the KS page).</p>\n<p>I’ll tweet him a link to this forum subject, maybe it’ll help.</p>\n<p>Regarding the FedEx bill, Darrell posted a project update (for backers only) on June 23rd mentioning this (emphasis mine):</p>\n<blockquote>Now one last addition, if you are international, there has been a shipping policy change and your phone number is needed for shipping. Please email that, with your name and KickStarter email address to jodie@greaterthangames.com. These will ship out within 2 weeks as <b>they are marrying the shipment with another game to ensure you don't pay taxes or handling</b>. If you'd like your game now, then please let Jodie know and she'll send it out this week.</blockquote>\n<p>This was definitely not the case for me. I never asked for the game to be sent right away, but still got the international charges.</p>\n<p>Should I contact the shipper/fulfiller for this, as Darrell suggested, or should I contact Darrell, as you suggest…?<br>\nI honestly don’t know, and I start to get the impression that no one wants to help me out. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/frowning.png?v=12\" title=\":frowning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":frowning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
